      "id": "s2_policy_text",
      "x": 140, "y": 828,
      "width": 1040, "height": 54,
      "text": "GROUP BY prompt length L  →  each bucket becomes one (B=|bucket|, L) rectangular batch\nWhy?  batched forward wants uniform (B, L) tensor — mixing L's forces pad+mask and wastes FLOPs",
