    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3_policy_text",
      "x": 140, "y": 1858,
      "width": 1040, "height": 54,
      "text": "PACK ALL not-finished reqs  →  one (B=|active|, L=1) batch  —  one token per req, read from token_pool\nWhy no grouping?  decode step always generates exactly 1 new token per req → seq_len is already uniform (=1); paged KV absorbs variable kv_lens via per-req page_table lookup",
      "originalText": "PACK ALL not-finished reqs  →  one (B=|active|, L=1) batch  —  one token per req, read from token_pool\nWhy no grouping?  decode step always generates exactly 1 new token per req → seq_len is already uniform (=1); paged KV absorbs variable kv_lens via per-req page_table lookup",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
