    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3_out_label",
      "x": 490, "y": 2028,
      "width": 680, "height": 80,
      "text": "Single Batch   (B=4, L=1)    →  engine.run_batch()\nsame batch composition every step,  kv_lens = [10, 12, 16, 15]  (varies across reqs)\npaged_kv_cache uses page_table[table_idx] to fetch each req's kv",
      "originalText": "Single Batch   (B=4, L=1)    →  engine.run_batch()\nsame batch composition every step,  kv_lens = [10, 12, 16, 15]  (varies across reqs)\npaged_kv_cache uses page_table[table_idx] to fetch each req's kv",
