      "id": "s4_takeaway",
      "x": 140, "y": 2740,
      "width": 1800, "height": 80,
      "text": "KEY  ▸  B only decreases.  GPU utilization falls off as tail reqs finish (tail latency = slowest req).  Continuous batching (Lesson 8) fixes this by\nadmitting new reqs mid-flight to keep B at B_max — but pays for variable-length handling and preemption.  Static batching trades that for simplicity.",
